const V080_GUIDE_TOPICS=[
['First steps','Home','Create your artist, choose a background, genre and city, then build your first audience. Backgrounds affect starting skills. The Player Guide stays available for the entire career.'],
['Career Inbox','Inbox','Inbox keeps briefings, celebrations and offers from disappearing. Unreviewed offers have no deadline. Pin anything you want to revisit.'],
['Energy and months','Home','You have 200 energy. Advancing a month resolves four or five chart weeks, settlements, tours, taxes, staff, investments and offer deadlines you have already reviewed.'],
['Make a song','Create','Choose a title, direction, production budget and creative brief. Write, record and mix in stages. Unfinished projects remain in your studio.'],
['Features and albums','Create','Add up to six guests to an active project. Finished recordings can be held for albums. Relationships, audience and reputation affect collaboration access and price.'],
['Training','Stats','Writing, Recording, Producing, Charisma and Marketability shape future work. Stage Presence, Touring and Viral Ability support live and audience systems.'],
['Charts and certifications','Industry','Charts resolve during monthly advances. Records can debut late, re-enter and earn certifications from lifetime performance.'],
['PULSE','Social','Posts, likes and replies influence engagement, label discovery and commercial leverage. Followers are reach; true fans are much stronger buyers.'],
['Offers Center','Offers','Label offers are separated from media, endorsements, brand deals, partnerships and lifetime commercial relationships. Review, counter, accept or decline from one place.'],
['Label contracts','Labels','Labels propose recording, distribution or 360 structures. As an artist you counter money, share and term—not the deal type. When you own a label, you may offer 360 contracts to your roster.'],
['Commercial deals','Offers','Deal value scales with fans, followers, engagement, reputation, awards, performance and marketability. Global icons can receive rare nine- and ten-figure partnerships or lifetime offers.'],
['Awards','Awards','The ENCORE Honors are industry awards, not Achievements. You compete against NPC artists across eight annual categories and can revisit every ceremony.'],
['Milestones and celebrations','Milestones','Milestones are career firsts and landmarks. Celebrations archive major chart, certification, tour and awards moments. Achievements remain unlockable game challenges.'],
['Catalog Market','CatalogMarket','Buy 10%, 25%, 50% or 100% economic interests in other artists’ catalogs, collect monthly distributions, hold through value changes, or sell later. Prices can fall.'],
['Touring','Touring','Plan 8–160 shows from clubs to stadiums. Fans, loyalty, performance and engaged social reach drive ticket demand. Exceptional global eras can cross $1B or $2B gross, but gross is never take-home profit.'],
['Merchandise','Commerce','Every merch category has multiple visual editions. Quantity and price affect risk; unsold inventory persists. Commercial sponsorship offers live in Offers Center, not Merchandise.'],
['Collection and assets','Wealth','Cars, property, jewelry, art and collectibles rotate through the market. Limited editions can disappear on the next monthly advance; owned items remain yours.'],
['Finances','Finances','Streaming, live, commercial, label-business and investment income feed the game tax system. A 360 can share media income; investments and outside catalog holdings remain excluded from the label share.'],
['Saves and recovery','Saves','Autosave stays tied to this browser career. Export a JSON backup before switching devices, clearing browser data or testing major updates.'],
['Navigation','Menu','The bottom bar opens Studio, PULSE, Home, Stats and Menu. The top controls always provide Back, Inbox, Guide and Settings. Menu searches every destination.']
];
